Rate limits y colas para LLM.ejemplo:
# Reintento con backoff exponencial + jitter usando tenacity en Python
from tenacity import retry, wait_random_exponential, stop_after_attempt, retry_if_exception_type

@retry(retry=retry_if_exception_type(RateLimitError),
       wait=wait_random_exponential(min=1, max=60), stop=stop_after_attempt(6))
def call_llm(messages): return client.chat.completions.create(model="gpt-4o-mini", messages=messages)

